  <h1 slot="sheet">Your volume, on local acquirers, at local prices.</h1>
  <p>Several local acquirers sit side by side in each market. No single acquirer limits the volume or concentrates the risk.</p>
  <p>You get local prices, local payment methods, and the same approval a local company gets.</p>
  <h2>What we do not do</h2>
  <p>The acquirer is a category, never one brand.</p>
  <p>We do not take our clients' merchants. We do not dispute their accounts. Two niches, no conflict of interest.</p>
  <h2>What we can do today</h2>
  <p>Today a partner is the Merchant of Record and carries the risk. We operate as the payment facilitator. We will be a sub-acquirer: own merchant IDs under the acquirers, not yet a payment institution.</p>
  <p>What we offer fits what we are licensed to do today.</p>
</PlacePage>
